    "💡 科学原理：人类大脑擅长记忆具象画面和语义关联，计算机暴力破解依靠指数穷举。使用 3 组自然意象词搭配符号与数字，密码熵达 50~70 bits，暴力穷举需数千万年，既固若金汤又过目不忘。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 Scientific Principle: The human brain excels at remembering vivid imagery and semantic associations, while brute-force attacks rely on exponential search. Using 3 natural imagery words paired with symbols and numbers achieves 50–70 bits of entropy—taking tens of millions of years to brute-force—rock-solid yet unforgettable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "💡 科学原理：人类大脑擅长记忆具象画面和语义关联，计算机暴力破解依靠指数穷举。使用 3 组自然意象词搭配符号与数字，密码熵达 50~70 bits，暴力穷举需数千万年，既固若金汤又过目不忘。"
          }
        }
      }
