            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了保护你的敏感账号与重要密码安全，\n请验证 Face ID 或锁屏密码以解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了保护您的密码保险箱、重要证件、记账及防丢清单等隐私数据，迁移备份必须设置 PIN 码。新手机导入时必须输入相同的 PIN 码解锁。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To protect sensitive data like password vaults, documents, ledgers, and packing lists, migration backups require a PIN. You must enter the same PIN to unlock on your new phone."
          }
