    "各文博场馆、5A景区、12306 及航司的放票政策（如提前预约天数、分时段放票整点）经常受旅游旺季或节假日临时调整。请以官方公众号、小程序或 12306 最新公告为准，并可在下方直接自定义确认您的提醒时间。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ticket release policies for museums, 5A scenic spots, 12306, and airlines (e.g. advance booking days, release hours) are often adjusted during peak seasons or holidays. Please refer to official announcements, and you can customize reminder times below."
          }
        },
