    "在出租车、餐厅、会议室起身时，强制停留 3 秒钟检查座位与桌面，可减少 80% 的物品遗落。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When leaving a taxi, restaurant, or meeting room, pause for 3 seconds to check your seat and table—this prevents 80% of forgotten items."
          }
        },
