    "所有密码完全保存在本设备私有沙盒中，绝不上传云端。支持生成高强度随机密码，并在密码长期未更换时自动提醒轮换更新。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All passwords are saved securely in this device's private sandbox and never uploaded to the cloud. Supports generating strong random passwords and reminds you to rotate old passwords."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有密码完全保存在本设备私有沙盒中，绝不上传云端。支持生成高强度随机密码，并在密码长期未更换时自动提醒轮换更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
